1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,403
Just landed in Australia on a working holiday visa?

2
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:05,853
Sort these three things before your first shift.

3
00:00:05,954 --> 00:00:07,833
One. Get a Tax File Number.

4
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:10,196
It's free, online, about twenty minutes,

5
00:00:10,196 --> 00:00:12,118
and you apply once you're in Australia.

6
00:00:12,118 --> 00:00:15,359
No TFN? Tax comes out at the top rate.

7
00:00:15,459 --> 00:00:19,552
Two. Ask if your employer is registered for working holiday makers.

8
00:00:19,552 --> 00:00:22,410
Registered employers withhold fifteen percent

9
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:24,884
on your first forty-five thousand dollars.

10
00:00:24,984 --> 00:00:29,401
Three. Super. Your employer must pay twelve percent on top of your wages,

11
00:00:29,401 --> 00:00:30,906
backpackers included.

12
00:00:30,906 --> 00:00:34,532
Keep your fund details: you can claim it after you leave Australia.

13
00:00:34,532 --> 00:00:36,248
It's taxed, but it's yours.

14
00:00:36,348 --> 00:00:38,145
Save this for your first week.

